# Bench uses the versioned 40-position contract and never emits bestmove.
@phase 4.3
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< setoption name Hash value 1
< bench 1 1
> {{EMPTY}}
> {{BENCH_POSITION_LINES}}
> {{EMPTY}}
> =========================
> Nodes searched  : {{U64}}
> Geomean EBF     : {{DECIMAL}}
> Median nodes    : {{U64}}
> Top-pos share   : {{DECIMAL}}%  ({{U64}} nodes)
> Total time (ms) : {{U64}}
> Nodes/second    : {{U64}}
! silence 100ms
< bench invalid
> info string invalid bench: depth must be a positive integer
< bench 1 1 1
> info string invalid bench: expected at most depth and repeats
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms

---

# Multiple repeats omit per-position detail and preserve run-one identity.
@phase 4.3
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< bench 1 2
> {{EMPTY}}
> run 1/2  nodes {{U64}}  time {{U64}}ms  nps {{U64}}
> run 2/2  nodes {{U64}}  time {{U64}}ms  nps {{U64}}
> {{EMPTY}}
> =========================
> Nodes searched  : {{U64}}
> Geomean EBF     : {{DECIMAL}}
> Median nodes    : {{U64}}
> Top-pos share   : {{DECIMAL}}%  ({{U64}} nodes)
> Nodes/second    : {{U64}}   (best of 2; median {{U64}}, min {{U64}})
! silence 100ms
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms

---

# Controller-side cancellation closes the queued bench/stop epoch race.
@phase 4.3
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< bench 6 1
< stop
> info string bench cancelled run 1/1 positions {{U64}}/40 nodes {{U64}}
! silence 100ms
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
